    "founding_year": {
      "value": 1997,
      "source": "https://headline.com/team/thomas-gieselmann/",
      "basis": "The firm's own bio of Thomas Gieselmann: 'Thomas co-founded Headline in 1997' (Bertelsmann Ventures, Santa Barbara). Wikipedia's infobox gives 1998 and its history text says Bertelsmann Ventures was 'initiated out of Germany already in 1997'; the homepage says 'Over 25 years'. BV Capital, with outside LPs, dates from 2000 (Wikipedia 'Headline (company)')."
