      "basis": "The firm's own statement: it invests 'from software and AI applications to consumer and fintech, and lead rounds at every stage' (meta description), with early funds per region and a global growth fund (fund pages US, EU, Global Growth). The landed entry distribution over the members is Series A 85, Seed 57, Growth 51, Pre-Seed 2 (restated in report.md)."
